#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:34
msgid ""
"Process environments which are defined in :ref:`projectconf` file remotely. "
"By default, :ref:`pioremote` builds project on a host machine and deploy "
"final firmware (program) to a remote device (embedded board)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you need to process project on a remote machine, please use :option:`pio "
"remote run --force-remote` option. In this case, :ref:`pioremote` will "
"automatically synchronize your project with remote machine, install required "
"toolchains, frameworks, SDKs, etc., and process project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:45
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:52
msgid "Process specified environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can also specify which environments should be processed by default "
"using :ref:`projectconf_pio_default_envs` option from :ref:`projectconf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:61
msgid ""
"Process specified targets. See :option:`pio run --list-targets` "
"documentation for available targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:67
msgid ""
"Custom upload port of embedded board. To print all available ports use :ref:"
"`cmd_remote_device` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:70
msgid ""
"If upload port is not specified, PlatformIO will try to detect it "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:75
msgid ""
"Specify the path to project directory. By default, ``--project-dir`` is "
"equal to current working directory (``CWD``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:81
msgid "Shows detailed information when processing environments."
msgstr ""

