"setting or by environment variable :envvar:"
"`PLATFORMIO_SETTING_FORCE_VERBOSE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:89
msgid ""
"Disable auto-clean of :ref:`projectconf_pio_build_dir` when :ref:"
"`projectconf` or :ref:`projectconf_pio_src_dir` (project structure) have "
"been modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_run.rst:95
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`pioremote` builds project on a host machine and deploy "
"final firmware (program) to remote device (embedded board)."
msgstr ""

